cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and also cite the DataCo dataset it is built on."
title: "RTO Shield AI - Model 1: pre-dispatch late-delivery risk scoring on public data"
type: software
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-24"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Academic prototype that scores the risk that an order is delivered late using only
  information known before dispatch, with calibrated probabilities, three risk tiers,
  SHAP reason codes and a Streamlit dashboard. The target is the DataCo late-delivery
  flag, not Return-To-Origin or Cash-on-Delivery behaviour.
